       "'Sound sleep by night; study and ease, / Together mixed; sweet recreation,' — sound sleep at night; a sweet blend of study and rest, sweet recreation.",
       "'And innocence, which most does please, / With meditation' — innocence and meditation give the greatest pleasure.",
