       "The banker held that the death penalty was more humane than life imprisonment, while the young lawyer held that life imprisonment was better.",
       "In the heat of the debate, the banker made a bet — if the lawyer could spend fifteen years in total solitary confinement, he would receive two million roubles.",
       "The lawyer was confined to a lodge on the banker's estate; he was not allowed direct contact with any person.",
