       "This story is taken from the 'Mitralabha' section of 'Hitopadesha' by Narayanapandita.",
       "In Piyusham the story is presented as a drama (dialogue) — characters speak to each other.",
       "An old tiger, after bathing at a pond's edge and holding kusha grass, disguises himself as a pious man.",
