       "This lesson contains two nazms by Nida Fazli: \"Bijli ka Khamba\" and \"Bahut Aasan Thi Pehle\".",
       "Nida Fazli was born in 1938 at Gwalior.",
       "He passed away in 2016 at Mumbai.",
       "Nida Fazli received honours like the Sahitya Akademi Award, Shikhar Samman, Ghalib Award and Khusro Award.",
       "His six poetry collections are: Lafzon Ka Pul, Mor Naach, Aankh Aur Khwab Ke Darmiyan, Khoya Hua Sa Kuchh, Sheher Mere Saath Chal and Zindagi Ki Tarap.",
